@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}
<h1 class="h3 mb-3">Privacy</h1>

<p>Voters do not need an account to use this site.</p>
<ul>
    <li>Your voting guide is kept only in a temporary session cookie on this server. It is not linked to your identity and is cleared after a few hours of inactivity or when you close your browser.</li>
    <li>Administrators who sign in receive an authentication cookie used only to keep them signed in.</li>
    <li>No tracking or advertising cookies are used.</li>
</ul>
